endo-gateway (0.1.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial Debian packaging for the Endo Gateway (Feature 10 of #343).
    Installs the systemd unit shipped at
    packages/gateway/systemd/endo-gateway.service, creates the endo:endo
    service account, and pre-creates the runtime / state / log / cache
    directories under /var/lib, /var/log, /var/cache, /run.

 -- Endo contributors <noreply@endojs.org>  Thu, 28 May 2026 00:00:00 +0000
